bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]goldens[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]capture-protocol[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture-protocol: add an isolated, versioned candidate-capture protocol [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]to the shared ACE and pager fixtures, with xdist-safe records, execution[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]completeness evidence, and focused regression tests. Preserve existing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rendering, convergence checks, and direct comparison behavior.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Compare candidates and safely apply screenshot changes[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]maintenance-runner[dim] · [dim][/dim]after capture-protocol[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]maintenance-runner: implement tools/fix_tui_screenshots with explicit [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]check mode, governed pytest execution, exact pixel comparison, bounded [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stability verification, conservative orphan handling, recoverable [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]application, and tests for failures and unchanged golden trees.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make every generated screenshot change reviewable[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]change-reports[dim] · [dim][/dim]after maintenance-runner[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]change-reports: extend the existing visual report pipeline to consume [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the run manifest and report created, updated, and stale screenshots, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]preserving before images, grouped diffs, contact sheets, JSON, CI [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]annotations, and durable per-run output on successful updates as well as[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]failures.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Switch commands, exhaustive verification, CI, and agent [/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]guidance[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]workflow-integration[dim] · [dim][/dim]after change-reports[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]workflow-integration: expose the canonical Just recipe, call its update [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]form from local check-full and its explicit check form from the existing[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]CI visual job, migrate old entry points and documentation, update the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]two relevant reference memories, and validate the combined workflow [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]before landing.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-12z","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-12z.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-4339f8822754756b0f69e07208a27c15","started_at":"2026-09-18T14:42:01.820535+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"f98c9a57277523c555f7538cd6f1471f4198eb51c493f75f23621078ff43d85e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-12z.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"2964a069825168d888f33dca8feff2e66b354a506f6311b0bcea7b6ff72bf495","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-12z.land/meta.json","size_bytes":618},"prompt":{"digest":"7bdb85f0b63d854541a82546dd9c85b2af94a527f480a4e77a633ae174242ddc","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-12z.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":231},"state":{"digest":"37e9137a3592122ba0a9e9dacb6110002a2fe1fb07dcff29ede1b2d4d0712399","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-12z.land/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-12z.land","local_name":"sase-12z.land","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-12z","agent_clan_generation":"20260918104116","approve":true,"bead_id":